    "cost_closing_html":  "About \u003cstrong\u003e$2.88 a bowl\u003c/strong\u003e for chicken pad thai with all the fixings. Restaurant pad thai runs $13 to $16 a plate, so even our priciest noodle bowl saves you around $10 every single serving.",
